  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Am&#xe9;lioration de la pr&#xe9;vention et r&#xe9;ponse holistique aux VBG et EAS dans les territoires affect&#xe9;s par les crises humanitaires, Nyiragongo et Rutshuru au Nord Kivu, et Irumu en Ituri, de septembre 2022 &#xe0; f&#xe9;vrier 2023.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Protection - Gender Based Violence assistance to vulnerable communities affected by violence in the Rutshuru Territory of the Democratic Republic of Congo. This UNFPA project provides assistance for 12,080 people to meet their needs, including 2,459 women, 2,468 men, 7,063 children, and 1,811 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
